'''The Ururuvu Journals''' (ウルルブ島滞在記, ''Ururubutō Taizaiki'', '''Ururubu Island Travelogue''') is the 4th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 102nd sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty. Each of its stages has [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]] as a boss, buffed to have 300% health and 500% attack power.

==Difficulty==
All stages here are very problematic, especially the last one. The player will encounter again Ururun Wolf accompanied by tough peons as well as enemies with [[Counter-Surge]], making the usage of Surge units dangerous.
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 2 enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]: An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Otta-smack-u]]. Deals low damage for this point in the game, gets knocked back 3 times and has even shorter range than Otta-smack-u, but possesses the ability to create a [[Surge Attack]] when hit by a [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]]'s Surge, along with 50 piercing range and a 50% chance to inflict knockback.
*[[Mystic Mask Yulala]]: An enemy returning from [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 40|Floor 40]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]], he has extreme health, damage, omni strikes that hit up to 400 range and 100% chance of [[Warp|warping]] away your cats back by 1,500 range for 1f.

